title documenting what is carried
prompt Keaton said kg caravan -- the last big number, 171 at 98.1%.
think Stopped using my own parallel awk to find the sites. It had been approximating the scan's binning, which is two implementations of one rule -- the fault this arc has booked repeatedly. Taught the scan to emit the uncovered contract sites itself, and it printed 400, matching its own gap exactly.
obs 117 of caravan's 171 already carried a labelled // invariant: comment TRAILING the assert. Moving those above is a pure transform -- the label is explicit, the words are the author's, nothing is judged.
obs Wrote 16 more by hand. 17 sit in pub fn check_*() u8 proof functions that the void condition keeps as contracts -- the cross-file rule erring safe, and writing invariants on test assertions would be REDS %213 again.
think Then the caravan suite red, and the first thing was to ask whether it was mine. Stashed and ran on clean HEAD: it red there too, on a roster bijection -- caravan_ladder_roster_witness.rish born 20260824.062207, seated on the standing roster the same day, and never added to the suite's own list. A witness born unheard, which is exactly what that bijection exists to catch. One entry closed it, 109 = 109.
obs Then a second red, and that one WAS mine. caravan_ladder_carry counts byte-for-byte duplicated function bodies across ladder rungs, and its ceiling had ZERO slack -- 58,544 against 58,544. My 20 blocks in bounded, chain and twin pushed it to 58,550.
think Those three files hold a byte-identical region body. A comment written into it costs three times what it reads, so documenting carried code raises the carry. That is a real tension between two disciplines and not a fault in either.
obs Refused every dishonest exit. Not raising the ceiling. Not making the three comments differ so the bodies stop matching. Reverted the 20 blocks, left those asserts uncovered on purpose, and recorded why -- the fold is the answer and it wants its own round.
obs The move-above transform across the other 37 files took FOUR carried lines off on its own, so the ceiling falls 58,544 to 58,540. The witness spells the number itself in two assertions, REDS %199's shape, and both moved with it.
obs A third meter followed, and this one my round IMPROVED. caravan_ladder_reach_visibility pins an exact triple, and the move-above transform took four lines out of the bodies below its fold line -- 63,655 to 63,651, with the above-fold count unmoved. Its pinned numbers moved with the measurement.
obs Two witnesses in one round spelling their own numbers, each needing a hand when an honest improvement lands. That is REDS %199's shape as a design choice rather than a fault -- a pinned triple records the lap it measured -- and it is worth knowing that every fall costs an edit.
obs The suite sang green at the end -- 109 Caravan witnesses registered and run, every rung of the Microkernel Target arc heard in one voice, after three reds that were each a different thing: one pre-existing and structural, one mine and real, one mine and an improvement.
